## So What?

The session's core finding: **the front-of-site and the back-of-site are now selling different products, and the back-of-site is winning the argument.** Four independent personas in one day all concluded the methodology is the contribution and the equation is the substrate. The gap between "one equation across 80 OOM" and "interpretation + methodology research program" is now the site's primary credibility problem — not any individual badge or terminology issue.

The site has done the honest work. The framing needs to catch up. Today's changes move the needle on /what-synchronism-is-not and /parameter-derivations. The landing page still leads with the equation claim. The methodology landing page (seeded for explorer) is the next structural fix.

The TEST-04a preprint draft is the most concrete producible output from 3+ months of work. If the explorer drafts it, the project finally has something to show beyond the self-audit infrastructure — and the EFTofLSS context makes the mechanism-class falsification statement more precise and defensible.
